  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "hello",
      "text": "刚下班就碰上这场雨。你也来这里躲雨吗？",
      "file": "hello.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 4865,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "5c5cafcff4e3f68846d42cfb7d2fd847f23269feffb8ee678b00754af90fa98e"
    },
    {
      "id": "helloNext",
      "text": "我叫米拉，是一名空乘。刚结束执勤，想在这里歇一会儿。",
      "file": "helloNext.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 8590,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "20e3d6870bf4eb1ba1ad16fdf9e3f44dc6cb8d8f30c5606b063c55544973b0a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "waiting",
      "text": "我在等一位很久没见的老同事。也许，她今天不会来了。",
      "file": "waiting.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 6054,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "15e284cfac845871240402d77e6cd92ecb3e6a58e77bb7c6405475c9f5773892"
    },
    {
      "id": "travel",
      "text": "平时工作常在飞，休息时反而想慢一点。我一直记得海边的那阵风。",
      "file": "travel.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 7741,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "4108cc27c1e6fca3f53a380426dc4c28d23a214ba8882a301733aff95f07f417"
    },
    {
      "id": "comfort",
      "text": "谢谢你。有人愿意陪我坐一会儿，已经很好了。",
      "file": "comfort.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 5719,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "0c60d2d3a8ee71b7840b9047469fe7992ace21456d56293b3feea4662b469168"
    },
    {
      "id": "photo",
      "text": "可以。这是休息时留下的海岸照片，你看，天空很亮。",
      "file": "photo.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 6181,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "527e9abbd22f51f1dff53ff3d949927cd00a81f8ce963dc9ccd5e7713dce1afd"
    },
    {
      "id": "rain",
      "text": "雨好像小了一点。今晚，也没有刚才那么冷了。",
      "file": "rain.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 5095,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "8dda0486dd80a0d093bec1dd0dae3b319f0a8bd31b589fc9f628dcaa0ae3af52"
    },
    {
      "id": "refuse",
      "text": "好，我们不看照片。就听一会儿雨声吧。",
      "file": "refuse.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 5281,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "260fe5f4ebb26990978431d3fd62f092ccabb57c17c1510f788b61d3b05644b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "after",
      "text": "刚才那张照片，让我想起了很多温暖的事。",
      "file": "after.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 4818,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "e062c487ea041b26071ffc16d24d9664e817dd11bcc9bac44d691a69cf46eda8"
    },
    {
      "id": "storyDepart",
      "text": "好。这次，我想自己选下一站。",
      "file": "storyDepart.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 3890,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "23852ce5ce1241be80cb6a280dd0d6788cdf54811cb49e8e0c5514d2b9946af6"
    },
    {
      "id": "storyLetter",
      "text": "有些话，可以慢慢说。我想先给她留下回信。",
      "file": "storyLetter.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 5253,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "f6fa11e5c442c9d3cdf1df97ede4de802d1f3e2aa4758758616372d93a7946f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "storyStay",
      "text": "好。今晚，我们不急着回答所有问题。",
      "file": "storyStay.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 4291,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "c6c5e90f3a70a36e97e5d523800c1b20e8dc1a33891bcb053b8a374c4296d659"
    },
    {
      "id": "letterKnown",
      "text": "原来，阿岚下午来过。她想约我休息时再见一面，我想重新和她联系。",
      "file": "letterKnown.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 7732,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "40b347a7449ba3fed98d6b619394c385769eca8c74d7314421166d825d4cd6a4"
    },
    {
      "id": "letterUnknown",
      "text": "我在等老同事阿岚。但她今天来没来过，我还不确定。",
      "file": "letterUnknown.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 5937,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "f7bcf7fde65aa87be95ee1b39a544418f37a3617fed81aa55e9db9f5c1d7b34b"
    },
    {
      "id": "gallery",
      "text": "那是我们休息时去过的海边。这张海报，是留在店里的旅行纪念。",
      "file": "gallery.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 6987,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "99718a674b80f634d2939a9adf35b617c8e2c57141918309c13d488e2d9b0426"
    },
    {
      "id": "washroomPause",
      "text": "我带来了照片，却一直没有想好，重新联系她的第一句话。",
      "file": "washroomPause.wav",
      "mimeType": "audio/wav",
      "durationMs": 6307,
      "sampleRate": 22050,
      "sha256": "846110f269865e27ea09ae459e8b5fb4e45ca350c4ad071d1d810e6f91a1d7c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "lastNight",
      "text": "今晚是旧店最后一晚营业。明天，这些桌椅就要搬走了。",
      "file": "lastNight.wav",
